{"id":"que_te","lemma":"quête","pos":"noun","rank":2890,"glosses":["quest, search"],"ipa":"/kɛt/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"quêtes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fa/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Simon_Villeneuve-qu%C3%AAte.wav","formAudio":{"quêtes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/37/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-qu%C3%AAtes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Comment se passe la quête d'un emploi ?","en":"How's the job hunt?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to pass","l":"passer"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"job"}]},{"text":"Elle est toujours en quête de compliments.","en":"She is always fishing for compliments.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"compliment","l":"compliment"}]},{"text":"C'était une quête futile.","en":"It was a wild goose chase.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"futile"}]},{"text":"Même maintenant, je suis en quête d'une solution.","en":"I'm seeking a solution even now.","words":[{"g":"same"},{"g":"now, currently"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"solution"}]},{"text":"N’êtes-vous pas en quête d’emploi ?","en":"Aren't you looking for work?","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"job"}]}]}